  "description": "Fair Deal Property New Homes Division are delighted to present to you for sale this stunning architecturally designed A-rated bungalow, located on the outskirts of Dunmore Town.\n\nThis exceptional newly constructed four-bedroom detached residence has been thoughtfully designed to combine striking contemporary architecture with outstanding energy efficiency, modern comfort, and timeless style. Set on a generous half-acre site, this beautiful home provides the perfect balance of spacious country living with the convenience of being just minutes from the heart of Dunmore and within an easy commute of Galway City.\n\nBuilt to the highest modern standards, the property boasts an impressive A2 BER and features an air-to-water heat pump, underfloor heating throughout, and a heat recovery ventilation system, delivering outstanding thermal performance, lower running costs, and exceptional indoor air quality. Triple-glazed windows and superior levels of insulation further enhance the home’s energy efficiency, ensuring year-round comfort and providing truly maintenance-free, future-proof living for many years to come.\n\nThe property is being offered for sale at builder’s finish, presenting the successful purchaser with the exciting opportunity to personalise the interior by selecting their own kitchen, floor coverings, bathroom sanitary ware, tiling, and other finishing touches to create a home that perfectly reflects their own taste and lifestyle.\n\nCurrently under construction, the property is expected to be ready for occupation in September 2026, making this an ideal opportunity to secure a superb new home in advance of completion.\n\nIn addition, the property is expected to qualify for both the Help to Buy Scheme and the First Home Scheme (subject to purchaser eligibility), making this an even more attractive and affordable opportunity for first-time buyers and qualifying purchasers.\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a beautifully designed, highly efficient new home that combines the very best of contemporary construction with the freedom to create an interior that is uniquely your own.\n\nCall Fair Deal Property New Homes Division today to register your interest. We would be delighted to hear from you, answer any questions you may have.\n\nBrought to you by Fair Deal Property, Your Trusted Partners for Residential Property Sales.",
